# Registration Turnstile is off. A world-region widget stays on Troubleshoot for
# readers in mainland China, because the challenge host there does not finish.
# This account is not allowed to create a China-region widget (Cloudflare:
# not entitled to create widgets with this region). Leave the key unset so a
# production build does not show the widget. To turn it back on, set the public
# site key here and the matching Pages secret TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY.
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
